@startuml
title Diagram zaporedja - Prijava neprimernega vedenja (osnovni tok)

actor "Uporabnik" as User
boundary "PregledSkupineMaska" as UI
control "PrijaveKontroler" as Controller
entity "Prijave" as Reports
entity "Uporabnik" as TargetUser

User -> UI: odpre skupino in izbere uporabnika (kršitelja)
activate UI

User -> UI: izbere možnost "Prijavi neprimerno vedenje"
UI -> Controller: odpriObrazecZaPrijavo(targetUserId, skupinaId)
activate Controller
Controller --> UI: obrazec
deactivate Controller
UI --> User: prikaže obrazec za prijavo

User -> UI: vnese opis incidenta
User -> UI: odda prijavo

UI -> Controller: oddajPrijavo(targetUserId, skupinaId, opis, jwtŽeton)
activate Controller

Controller -> Reports: shraniPrijavo(prijaviteljId, targetUserId, skupinaId, opis, timestamp)
activate Reports
Reports --> Controller: prijavaShranjena
deactivate Reports

Controller -> TargetUser: povečajŠtevecPrijav(targetUserId) (opcijsko za alarm)
activate TargetUser
TargetUser --> Controller: števecPosodobljen
deactivate TargetUser

Controller --> UI: potrditevPrejema
deactivate Controller
UI --> User: prikaže potrditev (prijava oddana)
deactivate UI
@enduml
